SHu7WDj3vfPFEwJfAFXJGNVtAP1Qnf8AFYFZpg&oe=6A3C03B8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Club Aloha VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "It's not just a multiplayer VR app. It's a live music venue where our Maui based musicians can see, hear and talk directly with you in real time!\n\n\u201cIt\u2019s the best music experience I\u2019ve seen in VR\u201d is what our fans tell us.\n\nClub Aloha is the first VR live music venue featuring real-time shows where fans and musicians can see, hear, and talk with each other just like a live concert. You are an avatar to them, and they are IRL to you. You\u2019ll swear you\u2019re at a real club! Musicians from Maui, Hawaii play your favorite radio hits\u2014 pop, rock, reggae, country, folk, and island classics every Tuesday evening. All in real-time and always in full fidelity stereo audio. Curious? Sideload the app now and give it a try! Then come back when we have a live event.", "short_description": "It's not just a multiplayer VR app. It's a live music venue where our Maui based musicians can see, hear and talk directly with you in real time!\n\n\u201cIt\u2019s the best music experience I\u2019ve seen in VR\u201d is what our fans tell us.\n\nClub Aloha is the first VR live music venue featuring real-time shows where fans and musicians can see, hear, and talk with each other just like a live concert. You are an avatar to them, and they are IRL to you. You\u2019ll swear you\u2019re at a real club! Musicians from Maui, Hawaii "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://clubalohavr.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://clubalohavr.com/tos", "publisher_name": "TelePresent Media, Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://clubalohavr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id"